ve more than once. So, these are not one-to-one functions. As a result, they are not invertible." 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403259 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403260 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403261 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403262 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403258 1075 #edb/ref 17592186403263 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403258 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403258 1077 "selection" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403258 1079 #edb/ref 17592186403262 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403258 1080 #uuid "ff70fd34-fe3d-556f-9676-12869b9e2163" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403259 1081 "I and III only" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403259 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403259 1084 #uuid "5a79b73a-03f6-5533-acf7-b5a1df8567d3" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403260 1081 "II and IV only" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403260 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403260 1084 #uuid "8f1c26d9-e125-518f-bb45-e4c39ea28969" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403261 1081 "I only" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403261 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403261 1084 #uuid "168d57eb-da99-5a01-9c14-4caceb4907e0" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403262 1081 "III only" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403262 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403262 1084 #uuid "a58e69ca-7b57-5342-91cd-29668910ad83" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403263 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533491 17592186045585 true] [17592186403263 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045